#: syncery_ui/menu/status_section.lua
msgid ""
"For cloud: pushes any changes you've made in books you've opened here, and pulls in whatever changed elsewhere — efficiently, without checking every book one by one. This also finds books you've never opened here that another device already has, and gets their reading progress and notes ready in advance, so they're waiting for you the moment you open them.\n"
"\n"
