#: syncery_ui/menu/annotations_section.lua
msgid ""
"What to do when another device reaches a new position in this book:\n"
"\n"
"Jump automatically — move to the new position, with a brief [Undo].\n"
"Ask first — show a tappable note; you choose whether to jump.\n"
"Never — stay put; this device is never moved by another.\n"
"\n"
"Either way you can still jump on demand from \"Jump to another device now…\" below.  Undo the last jump within 60 seconds from Menu → Syncery → This book → Undo last jump."
msgstr ""
"当其他设备在此书中到达新位置时的处理方式：\n"
"\n"
"自动跳转：移动到新位置，并短暂显示[撤销]。\n"
"先询问：显示可点击提示，由你决定是否跳转。\n"
"从不：保持当前位置，此设备不会被其他设备移动。\n"
"\n"
"无论如何，仍可在下方“立即跳转到其他设备…”中按需跳转。可在 60 秒内通过 菜单 → Syncery → 此书 → 撤销上次跳转 来撤销上次跳转。"

#: syncery_ui/menu/init.lua
msgid "When another device's annotations or font & layout arrive while you're reading, offer a [Reload] to apply them now. Off: they apply silently the next time you open the book."
msgstr "阅读时收到其他设备的批注或字体与版式时，显示[重新加载]以立即应用。关闭时会在下次打开书籍后静默应用。"

#: syncery_ui/menu/transport_section.lua
msgid ""
"When the device goes to sleep while offline, bring Wi-Fi up and push your latest position and annotations to the cloud before it actually sleeps — so they reach the server instead of waiting for the next time you open this book.\n"
"\n"
"The sleep screen appears right away, but the device finishes the handover behind it and only then really sleeps, so sleeping can take up to ~30 seconds worst-case while the connection comes up and the push completes.  If we raised Wi-Fi, it is turned back off again afterwards.\n"
"\n"
"Unlike closing a book, sleep happens automatically and often (every idle timeout), so waking Wi-Fi each time costs battery — enable only if reliable sync-on-sleep is worth that to you.  Respects your device's \"when network is needed\" setting.  Off by default."
msgstr ""
"设备离线休眠时，先唤醒 Wi-Fi 并将最新位置和批注推送到云端，再真正休眠，以便它们抵达服务器而不必等待下次打开此书。\n"
"\n"
"休眠界面会立即显示，但设备会在其后完成交接，随后才真正休眠；连接和推送完成时，最坏情况下休眠可能需要约 30 秒。若由本项开启 Wi-Fi，之后会再次关闭。\n"
"\n"
"与关闭书籍不同，休眠会自动且频繁发生（每次空闲超时），每次唤醒 Wi-Fi 都会耗电。仅在可靠的休眠同步对你足够重要时开启。遵循设备的“需要网络时”设置。默认关闭。"

#: syncery_ui/menu/transport_section.lua
msgid ""
"When you close a book (or quit KOReader) while offline, bring Wi-Fi up and wait for it before pushing your latest position and annotations to the cloud — so they actually reach the server instead of being silently held back until some later session.\n"
"\n"
"Respects your device's \"when network is needed\" setting: it only turns Wi-Fi on if that is set to turn it on automatically (not prompt or ignore).  Off by default.  Closing can pause for up to ~30 seconds worst-case while the connection comes up and the push completes."
msgstr ""
"离线关闭书籍（或退出 KOReader）时，唤醒 Wi-Fi 并等待联网，再将最新位置和批注推送到云端，确保它们到达服务器而不是被静默保留到之后的会话。\n"
"\n"
"遵循设备的“需要网络时”设置：仅当该设置为自动开启 Wi-Fi 时才会开启（不会提示或忽略）。默认关闭。连接和推送完成时，关闭操作最坏可能暂停约 30 秒。"

#: syncery_ui/menu/transport_section.lua
msgid ""
"When you open a book (or wake the device with one open) while offline, turn Wi-Fi on and pull the latest position and annotations from the cloud — so a device that read further while this one slept can offer its position right away, instead of waiting for the next manual connection.\n"
"\n"
"Uses KOReader's standard connection flow: its \"Connecting to Wi-Fi…\" notice shows while the radio comes up, and the pull lands a few seconds after it clears.  Acts only when \"when network is needed\" is set to turn Wi-Fi on automatically — it never asks.  After a failed connection attempt it stays quiet for a few minutes.  Off by default."
msgstr ""
"离线打开书籍（或设备打开书籍时唤醒）时，开启 Wi-Fi 并从云端拉取最新位置和批注，使其他设备在本设备休眠时读到更后位置后可立即提供位置，而无需等待下一次手动联网。\n"
"\n"
"使用 KOReader 标准连接流程：无线网络启动时会显示“正在连接 Wi-Fi…”，提示消失后数秒完成拉取。仅当“需要网络时”设为自动开启 Wi-Fi 才会执行，从不询问。连接失败后会静默数分钟。默认关闭。"

